  <releases>
    <release version="1.0.0" date="2026-04-21" type="stable">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/milnet01/perch/blob/v1.0.0/CHANGELOG.md#100--2026-04-21</url>
      <description>
        <p>First stable release. Perch remembers where each window belongs and restores geometry (position, size, monitor, virtual desktop) when a window reopens.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full backends for X11 and KWin / Plasma Wayland; community stubs for Mutter, Sway, and Hyprland.</li>
          <li>Rules engine with match patterns, named layouts, per-monitor profiles, and exclusions.</li>
          <li>Tray icon + PySide6 config dialog with dark-theme support, keyboard navigation, and accessibility labels.</li>
          <li>Global hotkeys via the xdg-desktop-portal GlobalShortcuts interface, with KGlobalAccel and XGrabKey fallbacks.</li>
          <li>Packaging for Flathub, openSUSE OBS, Fedora COPR, AUR, and the KDE Store.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
